      {
        "line": 104,
        "text": "* **Groth16** (Circom)"
      },
      {
        "line": 108,
        "text": "All results presented in **Section V** can be reproduced using the provided benchmark scripts for each backend."
      },
      {
        "line": 115,
        "text": "This README focuses on the quantitative results reported in **Table II** of **Section V** and **Table V** in Appendix I in the full version of our paper."
      },
      {
        "line": 118,
        "text": "The proposed protocol $\\Pi_\\text{ranha}$, when implemented using **Groth16**, achieves sub-second proving time on a laptop and remains practical on constrained hardware (e.g., Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W)."
      },
      {
        "line": 130,
        "text": "### Experiment (E1) \u2014 Groth16 Performance"
